# DRAFT-9812-puredata-0565-harmonyos-pc - OHOS Autotools bootstrap 依赖与 HMDFS

id:                     DRAFT-9812-puredata-0565-harmonyos-pc
trigger_tool:           autoreconf|configure|automake|m4|make
phase:                  build
error_signature:        config.guess.*unable to guess|config.status.*setup config files machinery|subs1.awk: Permission denied|C compiler cannot create executables|No rule to make target 'check'
severity:               3
category:               ohos, autotools, hmdfs, conan, build-system
match_keywords:         HarmonyOS, OHOS, Harmonybrew, Autotools, autoreconf, tool_requires, m4, HMDFS, config.status, config.guess, aarch64-unknown-linux-ohos
prescan_pattern:       config.status.*setup config files machinery|subs1.awk: Permission denied
prescan_globs:         conanfile.py, configure, configure.ac, Makefile.am, *.sh
title:                  OHOS 上 Conan 构建 Autotools 工具依赖时的 HMDFS 临时目录失败
root_cause:             Conan 对 m4 等 tool_requires 仅找到 recipe 时会从源码构建；依赖 configure/config.status 在 HMDFS 临时目录中创建后写文件被拒。profile 已提供的 Harmonybrew Autotools 工具可避免这条失败依赖链，但仍需 AutotoolsToolchain 显式传递编译器。
affected_scope:         HarmonyOS PC AArch64/musl 且 Harmonybrew profile 提供 Autotools 工具的 Conan 配方。
verification_cmd:       CONAN_HOME=~/work/psj/ch-pd9812 conan create archives/p/puredata/0.56.5 -pr:h=ohos-aarch64 -pr:b=ohos-aarch64 --build=missing
rec_priority:           1
rec_approach:           use-profile-harmonybrew-autotools
rec_description:        确认 profile PATH 已含受控 m4/autoconf/automake/libtoolize 后直接运行 autoreconf；按 E205 用随配方导出的 patch-autotools-ohos.pl 更新 config.guess/config.sub，使设备识别 HarmonyOS；使用 AutotoolsToolchain.generate() 显式映射 clang，不以 --build/--host 绕过系统识别。
rec_command:            command -v m4 autoconf automake libtoolize && conan create archives/p/puredata/0.56.5 -pr:h=ohos-aarch64 -pr:b=ohos-aarch64 --build=missing
rec_auto_fix:           false
rec_impl:               recipe-local-autotools-toolchain-and-system-bootstrap
fallback_priority:      2
fallback_approach:      use-published-ohos-tool-require-binaries
fallback_description:   若 profile 没有所需工具，先确认制品仓存在与当前 build profile 匹配的 Conan 工具包二进制；只有确有匹配包时才声明 tool_requires。若必须源码构建，先单独验证该工具包在 HMDFS 上的 configure/config.status。
fallback_command:       conan graph info archives/p/puredata/0.56.5 -pr:h=ohos-aarch64 -pr:b=ohos-aarch64
fallback_auto_fix:      false
fallback_impl:          verify-ohos-tool-package-availability
forbid_1_pattern:       tool_requires.*m4/1.4.19|make check.*No rule to make target|--build=.*--host=
forbid_1_reason:        当前 profile 没有匹配的 m4 二进制，源码构建会在 HMDFS 临时目录失败；Pure Data 的 14 个 Makefile.am 没有注册 TESTS/check_PROGRAMS，automake 生成的 check 目标不执行任何测试；用 triplet 参数掩盖 config.guess/config.sub 不识别 OHOS 违反 E205。
forbid_1_consequence:   Conan create 在被测包编译前失败，或把不存在的上游测试误写为通过。
principles:
causes:                 []
caused_by:              []
similar_to:             [E060, E110, E112, E114, E118, E122, E125, E126, E175, E205, E268, E407, E460, E468, E486, E490, E509, E510, E528, E533, E543]
conflicts_with:         []
prerequisite_of:        []
doc_file:               knowledge/drafts/DRAFT-9812-puredata-0565-harmonyos-pc.md
last_updated:           2026-10-03
source_event:           puredata/0.56.5 真实 HarmonyOS PC 构建；m4/1.4.19 依赖源码构建与系统 Autotools 对照验证
source_pr:              13882
source_commit:          fe3ba87a
authors:                iKalous_OscarP <iKalous_OscarP@noreply.gitcode.com>
